# Throwaway Playwright drivers -- screenshots, layout probes, contrast
# measurements. They are written at the repo root because that is the only
# place @playwright/test resolves from, and dot-prefixed so they stay out of
# the way. None of them are part of the project.
*shot*.mjs
/.*.mjs
# and the images they produce
.*.png

# Throwaway probe scripts. Review agents write these at the repo root so
# their imports resolve; three of them were swept into a commit by git add -A
# before this rule existed.
.audit-*
.ad-*
.*.mjs
.*.mts

# Scratch space for the reference-map derivation: the screenshots it reads, the
# rasters it caches, and the comparison images it draws. The derivation script
# itself lives in tools/map-build/reference/derive.
.ref/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tools/map-build/reference/derive/land.npy
